  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">#HackmyCity Hackathon Digital Twins</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The #HackmyCity! Hackathon Digital Twins, where South African and Dutch students will work together, aims to highlight the benefits of digital twins in policy-making for the City of Johannesburg.Therefore, the hackathon will be centred on the challenges the city is facing, facilitating the surfacing of local innovations and start-up implementation of those. Ideally, these innovations will help South Africa with its digital and development challenges, amplifying their impact and scaling them for more impact.</narrative>
  </description>
